WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.432
The great angel Jibril brought Allah's glad tidings: Maryam, you will have a son. His name will be Isa.

2
00:00:06.832 --> 00:00:14.584
Maryam was amazed. I am not married. How can I have a child? The angel said, When Allah says it shall be, it shall be.

3
00:00:14.984 --> 00:00:20.864
That is how Allah creates. Beneath a tree, Allah gave her a lovely baby. He was Isa.

4
00:00:21.264 --> 00:00:25.512
Maryam carried the baby back to her people. Everyone was astonished.

5
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:30.304
The people blamed her. Maryam calmly said, Speak to the baby.

6
00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:40.232
The baby spoke Allah's revelation: I am Allah's servant. Allah has given me the scripture and made me a prophet. He is a messenger sent by Allah.

7
00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:45.432
Isa is Allah's servant and prophet. All miracles come from Allah's power.
